@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

actor PSU
entity TPP
entity XS2A
entity SPI
== Submits a Verification of Party Request.==
PSU->TPP: PSU provides creditor information
activate TPP
TPP->XS2A: REST Call Submit Verification of Party\n"POST/v1/{party-verification-endpoint}
activate XS2A
note right of XS2A
Resquest validator
- validato path variables
- validate request body
- validate headers
validate party-verification-endpoint content
end note
XS2A->SPI: Java Call SPISubmitVerificationOfParty(IBAN, NAME, ... )
activate SPI
|||
SPI-->XS2A: SpiVerificationOfPartyResponse(MTCH/NMTC/ ... )
deactivate SPI
XS2A-->TPP: Verification of Party Response
deactivate XS2A
|||
TPP-->PSU: Response to PSU
|||
PSU->TPP: initiate payment
@enduml
